id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166857307,"discussion_id":"3707e84c0aacc4e1c8d62e4c9211ae78b9a2ba2c","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:30:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T16:30:31+08:00","user":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166857346,"discussion_id":"0189600cc4716fdcfc7997dd13aad2a79258203d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复混合精度计算（bfloat16/half）下的数值精度问题。在MoeInplaceIndexAdd算子的SIMT内核中，原有的累加操作直接在低精度类型上进行，可能导致精度损失和计算错误。本次修改旨在通过引入中间高精度变量进行累加，确保计算精度。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`SimtCompute`和`SimtComputeNoSort`两个核心计算函数中，针对bfloat16/half数据类型，修改了累加逻辑。具体方案是新增一个`float`类型的中间变量用于累加，将低精度数据先转换为`float`进行累加，最后再将结果转换回原始数据类型进行原子加操作。对于其他数据类型，则保持原有的累加逻辑不变。此修改通过`if constexpr`在编译时进行条件判断，以兼顾精度与性能。","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:30:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T16:30:42+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166857382,"discussion_id":"d1c83197ab08daac12b79ff82f96563f1e89c5f5","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>逻辑运算与副作用: 在代码第232行，变量名'reslut_f'存在拼写错误（应为'result_f'）。这个变量在第220行被声明为'float reslut_f = 0;'，并在第227行和后续代码中使用。拼写错误虽然不影响编译，但会降低代码的可读性和可维护性，